# Desires of Emptiness (CoP 5-2): the Memory Flux bitfield, one bit short each time (a GM sets Option). Bits 0,1,2,4
# and the Ponderer's flux: 53; finished, bit 3 is still missing: Status stays 0. Bits 2,3 only: 53; finished, bit 4
# is missing. Bits 0,4: 51; finished, bit 5 is missing. Bit 1 only: the Solicitor's flux plays 52; finished,
# bits 3 and 5 are missing.
lists PromyvionVahzl/_0mc/onTrigger PromyvionVahzl/_0md/onTrigger PromyvionVahzl/_0m0/onTrigger PromyvionVahzl/onEventFinish/51 PromyvionVahzl/onEventFinish/52 PromyvionVahzl/onEventFinish/53
char zone=PromyvionVahzl pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop DesiresOfEmptiness current
login
charvar Mission[6][518]Option 23
trigger _0m0
finish
charvar Mission[6][518]Option 12
trigger _0m0
finish
charvar Mission[6][518]Option 17
trigger _0mc
finish
charvar Mission[6][518]Option 2
trigger _0md
finish
